---
import ReturnToEvent from '../components/ReturnToEvent';
import '../styles/global.css';
export const prerender = true;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>GDG Bingo</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>GDG Bingo</h1>
      <p>Meet someone new. Find your next teammate.</p>
      <section class="panel">
        <h2>How to play</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Open the event link shared by your organiser and sign in with Google.</li>
          <li>Join with your private invitation. You get two outgoing codes.</li>
          <li>Find someone who matches a square and message them on Teams.</li>
          <li>Paste a code they give you to claim that square. Each code works once.</li>
        </ol>
        <p>A full row, column, or diagonal is bingo. The centre is free.</p>
        <p class="muted">Each person has only two codes to give. Your own codes are for other players. Both can go to the same person for different squares.</p>
      </section>
      <p>Use your organiser’s event link to join. This development build is awaiting its deployment and event-readiness checks.</p>
      <ReturnToEvent client:load />
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
